Z||000000||bHooper||05-17-2001||08:29 PM||||on monday, i'm picking up my "new" SE from Doug Kinney.  with it i can get a nice, remanufactured Advance Auto 2.8, that i can either install in the SE or my GT.  the downside to the whole deal is that it would cost me $150 to rent a trailer one way from there to Greensboro.<P>at that price, plus the price of the engine, i can buy a used 3.4, and have it delivered to my door.<P>so, how much would it cost me to mod the 3.4 to fit the fiero?  what kind of shop do i need to take it to to have the block drilled, and how much would that cost?  <P>outside of modifying the block, and replacing the injectors, there isn't much else to do but swap over all the components, right?<P>i don't know what to do... so i need some advice!<P>thanks!<BR>hoop||||reg||1
